    "segments": [
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 3,
        "sourceEnd": 41,
        "text": "Hi, Mei. You look tired. Are you okay?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "cf8f0dc47a5ef4e61ac2eee64f1c2faee6997f73620857671ff122dac78b0bdd",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 45,
        "sourceEnd": 157,
        "text": "Yeah, I’m fine. I just came back from the walking club. We walked for two hours because the weather was so nice.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "ca8da2bbbb328feef23281a0a664b7e48c032f0cc26e04aa9b068b2c0a03b9dc",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 161,
        "sourceEnd": 254,
        "text": "Two hours? That’s a lot. Why did you join a walking club? You usually prefer staying at home.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "d7f56f7950bcdfb0b46cb837369c93e1894a91de06077de387314d673d1304e7",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 258,
        "sourceEnd": 399,
        "text": "Well, I joined because my doctor said I need more exercise. But I also wanted to meet new people. So it’s good for my health and it’s social.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "549415fbfb0a72b770e56e938520dcc616b433c3f0f9e290399c2a7bd758e139",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 403,
        "sourceEnd": 450,
        "text": "I see. But isn’t it boring to walk for so long?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "1c136f6280b54473ec59d2165b24438e39fd0aca68630858e5485fa4297d8e2d",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 454,
        "sourceEnd": 574,
        "text": "Not really. We talk while we walk, so the time passes quickly. Although I was tired at first, now I feel more energetic.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "a9c04e5afb1945dd0abf8490caf1b14ad6888004c8cf376e8c57cef0ddd65270",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 578,
        "sourceEnd": 621,
        "text": "That sounds good. Can I join you next time?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "4814a2cf57bc6eb558499d2f41394ab92cb958009e0cba5f712431c6904c9503",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 625,
        "sourceEnd": 749,
        "text": "Of course! You can come if you want. But you might find it difficult at the beginning. The first walk is always the hardest.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "c623b3bf127c59b95e9a628af4630aee1a5ee3158b58d56bf411678cac679bd3",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 753,
        "sourceEnd": 792,
        "text": "I think I can manage. When do you meet?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "d0619a6f48d631956b63face6cf0e167db1fae43b0d6766f1ef144111963a971",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 796,
        "sourceEnd": 963,
        "text": "We meet every Saturday morning at 8 a.m. in the park. But last week we met at 9 because it was raining. The leader said we might change the time if the weather is bad.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "054b0fa48c64e7fd1d47562fc3a3581efc5401d2c13c2c65566d77acab07a298",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 967,
        "sourceEnd": 1014,
        "text": "Okay. So it’s usually at 8, but sometimes at 9?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "079303b795dd770c6a06b2d1e2e4836292961d438d1fddceb2b3b38190d8b73f",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1018,
        "sourceEnd": 1132,
        "text": "Yes, that’s right. You should check the club’s website before you go. Sometimes they change the meeting place too.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "752e9b1d45b9e39c6499f88f780e8a98274b3b72a004442f1e9bf45c5327ab4a",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1136,
        "sourceEnd": 1192,
        "text": "Thanks. I’ll check. By the way, do I need special shoes?",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "37b11ad853598b5095681d2317c1afea273c36ca774bcc0ee4228923046040d8",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1196,
        "sourceEnd": 1312,
        "text": "You can wear any comfortable shoes, but good walking shoes are better. You don’t have to buy expensive ones, though.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "35ca4271497f05dc52398392859bf04423d8ac57365ddbeafb70c7b5b030fa4e",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1316,
        "sourceEnd": 1413,
        "text": "Good to know. I might come this Saturday. But I’m not sure because I have to work in the morning.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "5b2768aebdd3feff676cc2bade2567ec2ad210e44fc943eda4790be0f47743f5",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1417,
        "sourceEnd": 1507,
        "text": "That’s fine. You can join us anytime. Even if you’re late, you can still catch up with us.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "919b3652e9c7e9d5645821a515cf6fb58a4cd2dc90e55850dcd9f598b06be492",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "m",
        "speaker": "M",
        "sourceStart": 1511,
        "sourceEnd": 1568,
        "text": "Great. I’ll try my best. Thanks for the information, Mei.",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-WilliamNeural",
        "textHash": "2fb50dadd0cb0bd7ef41ac152a4eeea3aa4227c3f02a8b87b27c05a0430acec9",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      },
      {
        "role": "w",
        "speaker": "W",
        "sourceStart": 1572,
        "sourceEnd": 1615,
        "text": "You’re welcome. See you on Saturday, maybe!",
        "boundary": "turn",
        "voice": "en-AU-NatashaNeural",
        "textHash": "327054bcb9d44875cbd0b18e494e7d1b986f0fe11520c480214da663cfd2b961",
        "pauseBeforeSeconds": 0.65
      }
    ]
  },
